  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "dg_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -264
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Differential growth\n\nThe Simulation node's `growth` mode: a ring of nodes that push each other away (`repel`) while each pulls towards its neighbours (`align`). New nodes keep appearing on random edges (`grow` a second) and edges that stretch past `maxEdge` split in two; the extra length has nowhere to go but sideways, and the curve folds like coral or the surface of a brain, up to `maxNodes`.\n\n`colors` ramp the edges by age, oldest first, over the style's fill. Click the Bang to grow it again; try a shape on `shape`, e.g. a line for an open curve.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Differential growth\n\nThe Simulation node's `growth` mode: a ring of nodes that push each other away (`repel`) while each pulls towards its neighbours (`align`). New nodes keep appearing on random edges (`grow` a second) and edges that stretch past `maxEdge` split in two; the extra length has nowhere to go but sideways, and the curve folds like coral or the surface of a brain, up to `maxNodes`.\n\n`colors` ramp the edges by age, oldest first, over the style's fill. Click the Bang to grow it again; try a shape on `shape`, e.g. a line for an open curve.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
